URL Filter Service - Cross-Platform URL Filtering System

Usage:
  UrlFilterService.exe                 - Run as Windows service
  UrlFilterService.exe /install        - Install Windows service
  UrlFilterService.exe /uninstall      - Uninstall Windows service
  UrlFilterService.exe /console        - Run in console mode for testing
  UrlFilterService.exe /block <domain> - Add a domain to the blacklist
  UrlFilterService.exe /unblock <domain> - Remove a domain from the blacklist
  UrlFilterService.exe /list           - List all URL list entries
  UrlFilterService.exe /help           - Show this help

Administrator privileges are required for install/uninstall operations.
